  "The TUI exposes these 15 model configuration fields through its persisted JSON editor.": "TUI 通过持久化 JSON 编辑器提供这 15 个模型配置字段。",
  "The Web client polls this device flow using the provider interval. You can also press Continue auth.": "Web 客户端会按服务商给出的间隔轮询设备授权流程，也可手动点击“继续认证”。",
  "The fallback for any tool the Name Rules below do not name. The interaction tool is a Name Rule; write its name there to change it.": "下面是「名称规则」没有点名的工具所落到的默认值。询问工具就是一条名称规则，想改它就在那里写下它的名字。",
